            <h1 id="hero-title">Backend API Documentation & Project Info</h1>
            <p>
              A full-featured RESTful backend for a fragrance e-commerce
              platform. Built with Node.js, Express, MongoDB and Redis —
              featuring JWT authentication, multi-variant products, Stripe &
              PayPal integration, and Swagger API documentation.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
