      <section class="bestsellers" id="features">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="bestseller-copy">
            <h2>Key Features</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Multi-variant product support (sizes/volumes) with per-variant
                stock & pricing
              </li>
              <li>
                JWT authentication with refresh tokens stored in Redis and
                refresh rotation
              </li>
              <li>
                Persistent shopping cart (MongoDB), cart synchronization, and
                discount system
              </li>
              <li>
                Checkout flow with Stripe and PayPal integrations, payment
                callbacks and verification
              </li>
              <li>
                Order lifecycle (pending → processing → shipped → delivered) and
                stock adjustments
              </li>
              <li>
                Admin features: user/product/order management, comment
                moderation, role-based access
              </li>
              <li>
                CAPTCHA protection, Nodemailer email templates, Cloudinary image
                uploads
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="story" id="tech">
        <div class="container">
          <h2>Tech Stack</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Core:</strong> Node.js + Express.js<br />
            <strong>Database:</strong> MongoDB (Mongoose)<br />
            <strong>Cache/Session:</strong> Redis<br />
            <strong>Auth:</strong> JWT + bcrypt<br />
            <strong>Validation:</strong> Joi<br />
            <strong>Payments:</strong> Stripe & PayPal<br />
            <strong>Storage:</strong> Cloudinary<br />
            <strong>Docs:</strong> Swagger UI<br />
            <strong>Utilities:</strong> Winston (logging), svg-captcha, multer
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="testimonials" id="install">
        <div class="container section-heading">
          <h2>Installation</h2>
          <ol>
            <li>
              <strong>Clone the repository:</strong>
              <pre>
git clone https://github.com/amirhossein-zareei/Perfume_shop.git
cd Perfume_shop</pre
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Install dependencies:</strong>
              <pre>
npm install
# or
yarn install</pre
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Copy environment template and configure:</strong>
              <pre>cp .env.example .env</pre>
              <p>
                Edit <code>.env</code> with your MongoDB, Redis, Cloudinary,
                Stripe/PayPal, and email credentials.
              </p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Seed geographic location data</strong> (required for
              addresses & checkout):
              <pre>npm run seed &lt;countryName&gt;</pre>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Run in development:</strong>
              <pre>npm run dev</pre>
              <p>
                Visit <code>http://localhost:{port}/api-docs</code> for local
                Swagger UI.
              </p>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="newsletter" id="api">
        <div class="container">
          <h2>API Documentation</h2>
          <p>
            Interactive Swagger docs are available at:
            <a
              href="https://perfume-shop-f8ys.onrender.com/api-docs/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="link"
              >Live Swagger Documentation</a
            >
          </p>

          <h3>Quick Endpoints Overview</h3>
          <div class="api-endpoints">
            <div class="endpoint-group">
              <h4>Auth</h4>
              <pre>
POST   /api/v1/auth/register
POST   /api/v1/auth/login
POST   /api/v1/auth/logout
POST   /api/v1/auth/refresh-token
GET    /api/v1/auth/captcha
POST   /api/v1/auth/forgot-password
POST   /api/v1/auth/reset-password/:token</pre
              >
            </div>

            <div class="endpoint-group">
              <h4>Products</h4>
              <pre>
GET    /api/v1/products
GET    /api/v1/products/:slug
POST   /api/v1/admin/products
PUT    /api/v1/admin/products/:slug
DELETE /api/v1/admin/products/:slug</pre
              >
            </div>

            <div class="endpoint-group">
              <h4>Cart & Checkout & Orders</h4>
              <pre>
GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE    /api/v1/cart
POST/GET/PATCH/DELETE    /api/v1/checkout
POST /api/v1/checkout/payment
GET  /api/v1/checkout/callback
GET  /api/v1/orders
GET  /api/v1/orders/:orderNumber</pre
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="collections" id="project-structure">
        <div class="container section-heading">
          <h2>Project Structure</h2>
          <div class="markdown-content">
            <pre><code class="language-markdown"># Perfume Shop - Backend API

## 📁 Project Structure

```
Perfume_shop/
├── src/
│   ├── config/         # Database, Redis, Cloudinary, Swagger configuration
│   ├── middlewares/    # Authentication, validation, error handling
│   ├── models/         # MongoDB models (User, Product, Order, etc.)
│   ├── modules/v1/     # API modules
│   │   ├── auth/       # Authentication & authorization
│   │   ├── user/       # User management
│   │   ├── product/    # Product catalog
│   │   ├── cart/       # Shopping cart
│   │   ├── checkout/   # Checkout process
│   │   ├── order/      # Order management
│   │   ├── comment/    # Reviews & comments
│   │   └── address/    # User addresses
│   ├── services/       # Business logic & external services
│   ├── templates/      # Email templates (HTML/Text)
│   ├── utils/          # Helper functions & utilities
│   ├── app.js          # Express app configuration
│   └── server.js       # Server entry point
├── data/               # Static data & seeds
├── scripts/            # Utility scripts (seedLocations.js)
├── .env.example        # Environment variables template
├── package.json        # Dependencies & scripts
└── README.md           # Project documentation
```

## 🚀 Quick Start

1. Clone & Install
2. Configure environment (.env)
3. Seed location data
4. Run development server
5. Access Swagger docs at `/api-docs`
</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

